       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HERESY-APP.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ACCOUNT     PIC X(80).
       01 WS-RULE        PIC X(80).
       01 WS-EVIDENCE    PIC X(80).
       01 WS-CASE-ID     PIC X(32).
       01 WS-DECISION    PIC X(64).
       01 WS-CODE        PIC X(32).
       01 WS-SCORE       PIC X(8).
       01 WS-REMEDIATION PIC X(96).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_ACCOUNT"
           ACCEPT WS-RULE FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_RULE"
           ACCEPT WS-EVIDENCE FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_EVIDENCE"
           ACCEPT WS-CASE-ID FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_CASE_ID"
           ACCEPT WS-DECISION FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_DECISION"
           ACCEPT WS-CODE FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_POLICY_CODE"
           ACCEPT WS-SCORE FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_SCORE"
           ACCEPT WS-REMEDIATION FROM ENVIRONMENT "H360_REMEDIATION"

           DISPLAY "============================================================"
           DISPLAY " HERESY/360 AUTOMATED ACCOUNT DECISION TERMINAL"
           DISPLAY " COBOL FRONT END / NO MYSTERY MEAT GOVERNANCE"
           DISPLAY "============================================================"
           DISPLAY "CASE          : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CASE-ID)
           DISPLAY "ACCOUNT       : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACCOUNT)
           DISPLAY "RULE          : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-RULE)
           DISPLAY "EVIDENCE REF  : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EVIDENCE)
           DISPLAY "DECISION      : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DECISION)
           DISPLAY "POLICY CODE   : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CODE)
           DISPLAY "TRANSPARENCY  : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-SCORE) "/100"
           DISPLAY "NEXT STEP     : " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-REMEDIATION)
           DISPLAY "------------------------------------------------------------"
           DISPLAY "AUTOMATION MAY BE FAST. DUE PROCESS STILL NEEDS A RULE."
           DISPLAY "IF THE SYSTEM SAYS 'SPECIFICALLY:' IT MUST SPECIFY SOMETHING."
           DISPLAY "============================================================"
           STOP RUN.
